# Role matrix (C305, C314.1): every registered operation x principal row, as api.Permitted answers it.
# Y allowed; OO owner-only (403 OWNER_ONLY); HO human-only (403 HUMAN_ONLY); SC missing scope (403 FORBIDDEN_SCOPE).
# Columns: op, scope, hold, then owner, editor, listener, agent-read, agent-write, agent-admin, device, device-editor, device-listener.
# hold names the lane that lifts a fail-closed OwnerOnly hold (plan revision 5); "-" means none.
